{"id":"n53521ca220","headline":"Fuel: government does not extend excise discount and awaits EU","summary":"Meloni's government did not extend the fuel excise discount and launched no new tax-relief mechanism. It is awaiting the EU summit on 15–16 October before deciding on mobile excise duties.","why":"Excise duties form a large part of Italian pump prices, so changes to them directly affect fuel costs for consumers and businesses.","category":"economy","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Rome","country":"Italy","lat":41.9,"lon":12.5,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"euronews","url":"https://ru.euronews.com/2026/10/07/fuels-the-government-does-not-extend-the-excise-duty-discount-and-waits-for-the-eu"},"sources":[{"name":"euronews","url":"https://ru.euronews.com/2026/10/07/fuels-the-government-does-not-extend-the-excise-duty-discount-and-waits-for-the-eu"}],"published_at":"2026-10-07T10:34:37Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-13T13:37:32Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"36a0214c63325f93","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-13T13:37:32Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-07T10:34:37Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-07T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"SP","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"Топливо: правительство не продлевает скидку по акцизам и ждёт ЕС","source_language":"rus","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-refinery-5385905.jpg","alt":"oil refinery (illustration)","credit":"Tho-Ge","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/rhine-industry-factory-ship-5385905/"}}